  "details": "Im going to use a person A and B example to explain this. Person A turns on their safe mode, to which person B, which was not muted before hand, gets muted. On person A's end, they can see the \"User muted\" icon in person B's nameplate; however on person B's end, the \"user has you muted\" icon does not show on person A's nameplate. \n\nI am not sure if this issue is on PC or any other platform, but it most likely is.",
